## Issues Discovered

### 1. ID Drift Between Seasons
- Original 28 IDs from earlier extraction ≠ current index page IDs
- Example: Mayke (214181) → redirects to Eduard Atuesta profile
- Flaco López old ID 214189 → new ID 224097
- Rony old ID 214190 → replaced by Paulinho 265723

### 2. Broken/Generic Profiles
- Gustavo Gómez (2297): Returns generic silhouette, no data
- Murilo (214180): Returns "Lomba-transp-1" placeholder
- Some profiles load old news articles instead of player data

### 3. Photo Mismatch (Site Bug)
- Alexander Barboza (287141): Profile photo shows Gabigol (meme/placeholder)
- Vision analysis correctly detected the mismatch

### 4. New Signings Not in Original 28
- Vitor Roque (267679) - #9
- Paulinho (265723) - #10  
